  message: "DONE (option c): merged in PR #1387. AnalysisRun.cpu_ms = CPU time of the thread that ran the pass (PassClock, thread_time_ns, raises if read on another thread); stamped at the analyzer pool's worker wrapper, the linker chokepoint (serial and parallel) and the six serial synthesis passes, where duration_ms now comes from the same clock over the same call; null = not measured; schema 0.20.14. Behavioural evidence: test_pass_clock.py (burning vs sleeping pass); removing each stamp reds exactly the expected 6 tests. Live: cpu_ms sums 5.44 s vs 5.44 s process CPU and 103.94 s vs 104.14 s, while duration_ms sums 21.82 s / 157.65 s inside 6.47 s / 135.67 s phases; microservices-demo 87/87 cards carry cpu_ms, bash 1319 ms wall vs 70 ms CPU. NOT asserted: cpu_ms is load-invariant (moved 1.38x), or the item's 21x figure (not reproduced). Residual: WI-tuhan (P3).\nFull report (closure evidence, measurements, residuals): /home/jgstern_agent/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_09302026/nuvam.md"  # 75bb
